<<include"Thomas NPC Character Menu Avatar Display">>

<<if $ThomasSocial > 50>>
    Thomas Byrne is your friend and classmate. While a loner who seems to mostly prefer his own company, you do catch the occasional smile or curious glance your way whenever you hang around him. Despite the bad boy attitude he puts up, you’re pretty sure he enjoys your company. He likes to spend time quietly doodling away or getting lost in his own thoughts when he isn’t passing out due to lack of sleep. <br>
    <br>
<<elseif $ThomasSocial > -10>>
    Thomas Byrne is the quiet loner of Preston. He can often be found on his own quietly doodling away in his notebook. He doesn’t have the best reputation and is known to fall to anger quickly and will easily snap at those that annoy him. This has left him often on his own, but he doesn’t seem to mind this at all. Most people leave him alone out of fear of being punched or worse. <br>
    <br>
<<else>>
    Thomas Byrne is the bad boy loner Preston. He can often be found brooding away on his own like he’s too cool to care about what anyone else thinks. People see him as some scary tough guy that shouldn’t be messed with, but you just see him as a quiet loser who lets his emotions get the best of him. <br>
    <br>
<</if>>

<<if $CompletedQuests.includes("Thomas: Out Sick")>>
    After Thomas was out sick for a few days, you were sent by Headmaster Alistair to deliver his homework. You learned that Thomas lives in the trailer park with his father and younger brother Ethan, who seems a bit aloof and shy, only whispering to Thomas when you are around. Thomas seemed a bit caught off-guard and embarrassed when you showed up at his house, but not as upset as you expected. <br>
    <br>
<</if>>

